---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ListenSection from '../components/ListenSection.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Studio — Anthony Craythorn Sound Design" description="Brunswick based studio for vocal recording, production polish, mixing and mastering.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Brunswick studio</p>
        <h1>Studio</h1>
        <p class="lede">Brunswick based studio for mixing and vocal recording.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/contact">Inquire Now</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="portrait-card">
        <img src="/images/studio-hero.png" alt="Anthony's Brunswick recording studio" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ListenSection />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-inner split">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
        <h2>What I do</h2>
        <div class="prose studio-about">
          <p>Most of what I mix is large cast recordings, musicals and orchestral sessions. With dense arrangements, getting everything balanced is one half of the job. The other half is directing the listener to what matters most at each moment (a lyric, a melody, the whole orchestra lifting) and making sure that's what grabs your ear. I pride myself on finding creative ways to realise this in every mix I touch.</p>
          <p>You can hear my most recent cast recording, Beetlejuice, just above.</p>
          <p>I also love taking on smaller projects in my Brunswick studio, like singer-songwriters, indie bands and things you've recorded yourself at home.</p>
          <p>Whatever your style or budget, I would love to work with you. Please reach out below.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button dark" href="/contact">Get In Touch</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="image-tile">
        <img src="/images/studio-mic.png" alt="Studio microphone setup" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
